<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:50:04 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>凯利说，人工智能可以为旅行者提供公平的竞争环境</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/ai-can-level-playing-field-for-travelers-kelly-says-video</link><description>“积分专家”布莱恩·凯利 (Brian Kelly) 表示，人工智能可以帮助为航空旅客创造公平的竞争环境，并表示尽可能快地使用这些航空里程。他在“彭博监视”节目中发表讲话。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/ai-can-level-playing-field-for-travelers-kelly-says-video'&gt;凯利说，人工智能可以为旅行者提供公平的竞争环境&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：AI Can Level Playing Field for Travelers, Kelly Says&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/ai-can-level-playing-field-for-travelers-kelly-says-video</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:07:24 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>股市上涨削弱避险需求，国债回落</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/treasuries-retreat-as-gains-in-equities-sap-demand-for-havens</link><description>随着感恩节假期后市场重新开放，美国国债交投清淡，亚洲股市上涨抑制了对避险资产的需求。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/treasuries-retreat-as-gains-in-equities-sap-demand-for-havens'&gt;股市上涨削弱避险需求，国债回落&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Treasuries Dip on Weaker Demand for Havens as Stocks Rebound&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/treasuries-retreat-as-gains-in-equities-sap-demand-for-havens</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 02:43:08 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>卢拉任命银行家为财政部长后巴西资产上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/brazil-assets-rally-after-lula-names-banker-luiz-carlos-trabuco-cappi-finance-minister</link><description>在该国最著名的银行家之一被任命为新财政部长后，巴西资产上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/brazil-assets-rally-after-lula-names-banker-luiz-carlos-trabuco-cappi-finance-minister'&gt;卢拉任命银行家为财政部长后巴西资产上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Brazil Markets Rally as Trabuco Pick Soothes Fiscal Fears&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/brazil-assets-rally-after-lula-names-banker-luiz-carlos-trabuco-cappi-finance-minister</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 01:08:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>降雨缓解了巴西主要大豆产区对厄尔尼诺现象的担忧</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/rains-ease-el-nino-crop-fears-in-brazil-s-top-soybean-region</link><description>巴西顶级大豆产区深处一片生机勃勃、绿叶茂盛的绿色植物海洋，缓解了人们对厄尔尼诺现象会给世界顶级大豆生产国带来农作物损失的担忧。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/rains-ease-el-nino-crop-fears-in-brazil-s-top-soybean-region'&gt;降雨缓解了巴西主要大豆产区对厄尔尼诺现象的担忧&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Rains Ease El Niño Crop Fears in Brazil’s Top Soybean Region&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/rains-ease-el-nino-crop-fears-in-brazil-s-top-soybean-region</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:42:01 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11 月 27 日最新石油市场新闻和分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-27</link><description>由于中东能源基础设施和油轮遭受袭击引发了人们对敌对行动升级的担忧，油价本月首次出现周度上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-27'&gt;11 月 27 日最新石油市场新闻和分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 27&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-27</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:05:38 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>